# Environment variables — Freedom Paws

Copy to `.env.local` for local production testing, or set in Vercel/hosting dashboard.

```bash
# preview = blocks search engines, shows private banner (use until LLC/TM launch)
# public = normal indexing when you are ready to announce
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_MODE=preview

# Admin login for /admin/symptoms symptom lexicon review
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-strong-password-here
```

## Site URLs (Framer ↔ app — P0)

```bash
# App PWA base — set when app.freedompawsinc.com DNS is live on Vercel
# Until then: https://YOUR-PROJECT.vercel.app
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://app.freedompawsinc.com

# Framer marketing site (defaults to https://freedompawsinc.com if unset)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com

# Optional — override if Framer page slugs differ
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_GRANTS_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/grants
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_MISSION_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/mission
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_VETERANS_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/veterans
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FRAMER_SHELTERS_URL=https://freedompawsinc.com/shelters
```

## Supabase (Freedom Paws ID + server-backed My Pets)

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
# Run supabase/migrations/001 through 008 in Supabase SQL Editor
# 008 = AI Magic Look credits (Photo Booth metering)
# Optional — server-only; required for AI credits + match emails
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
# Optional — reply-to for match emails
# FP_SHELTER_SUPPORT_EMAIL=shelter@freedompawsinc.com
```

## ViT / AI

```bash
OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_VISION_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Ops SuperBud social studio — Buffer / n8n bridge (optional; dry-run without)
# BUFFER_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-n8n.example/webhook/buffer-draft
# N8N_SOCIAL_BUFFER_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-n8n.example/webhook/buffer-draft

# Photo Booth — AI Magic Look holiday costumes (Replicate FLUX Kontext Pro)
REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=

# AI Magic Look — monthly allowances (Supabase migration 008)
# AI_CREDITS_GUEST_MONTHLY=3
# AI_CREDITS_FREE_MONTHLY=5
# AI_CREDITS_MEMBER_MONTHLY=20
# AI_CREDITS_FOUNDING_MONTHLY=30
# AI_CREDITS_DAILY_CAP=10
# AI_CREDITS_GUEST_DAILY_CAP=5
# AI_CREDITS_MIN_INTERVAL_SEC=25
```

## Email — match owner alerts (Resend)

```bash
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# Verified sender in Resend dashboard (use onboarding@resend.dev for Resend sandbox)
RESEND_FROM_EMAIL=Freedom Paws ID <notifications@freedompawsinc.com>
# Comma-separated emails auto-promoted to fp_ops (match review)
FP_OPS_EMAILS=you@freedompawsinc.com
# Enable Email provider (magic link) in Authentication → Providers
```

## Xaman / XRPL checkout (P1 — primary payment rail)

```bash
# API key — you may already have NEXT_PUBLIC_XUMM_API_KEY on Vercel
NEXT_PUBLIC_XUMM_API_KEY=
XUMM_API_KEY=
# REQUIRED server-side secret (never expose to browser)
XUMM_API_SECRET=

# Where protocol payments are sent (your XRPL r-address)
XRPL_TREASURY_ADDRESS=rYourTreasuryAddress

# RLUSD (optional — enables RLUSD pay button)
XRPL_RLUSD_ISSUER=rMxCKbEDwqr76QuheSUMdEGf4B9xJ8m5De
# XRPL_RLUSD_CURRENCY=RLUSD
```

## Stripe (alternative #2 — card / fiat, not primary)

```bash
# Create a $18 Product in Stripe Dashboard → copy Price ID
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_PROTOCOL_PRICE_ID=price_...
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=  # optional — for server-side unlock webhooks later
```

## Wellness partners — insurance affiliate + holistic telehealth

Affiliate/referral links only. Freedom Paws does not provide veterinary medical care.
When ViT flags concern, panels funnel to ID enrollment, telehealth, and insurance CTAs.

```bash
# Insurance affiliate (quote / lost-dog / urgent-care deep links from partner dashboard)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_INSURANCE_ENABLED=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_INSURANCE_PARTNER_NAME=Lemonade Pet Insurance
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_INSURANCE_QUOTE_URL=https://partner.example.com/quote?ref=freedompaws
# Optional — defaults to QUOTE_URL if unset
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_INSURANCE_LOST_DOG_URL=https://partner.example.com/lost-dog?ref=freedompaws
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_INSURANCE_URGENT_URL=https://partner.example.com/urgent?ref=freedompaws

# Holistic / integrative veterinary telehealth partner
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_TELEHEALTH_ENABLED=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_TELEHEALTH_PARTNER_NAME=Holistic Vet Telehealth Partner
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_TELEHEALTH_BOOK_URL=https://partner.example.com/book?ref=freedompaws
# Optional — displayed in partner panel
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_TELEHEALTH_FOCUS=Holistic and integrative veterinarians aligned with Freedom Paws protocols.
```

## Protocol affiliate picks (`/protocols/[slug]`)

Curated whole-food & safe-product partners per protocol. Catalog brands show as **Launching soon** until tracking URLs are set.

```bash
# Master toggle (default on; set false to hide all protocol affiliate sections)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_PROTOCOL_AFFILIATES_ENABLED=true

# Example — Gut Balance protocol, pick slot 1 (Honest Kitchen)
# Slug gut-balance → env key GUT_BALANCE
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_PROTOCOL_GUT_BALANCE_AFF_1_URL=https://shareasale.com/r.cfm?b=...&u=freedompaws
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_PROTOCOL_GUT_BALANCE_AFF_1_NAME=The Honest Kitchen
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_PROTOCOL_GUT_BALANCE_AFF_1_LABEL=Digestive whole-food base

# Example — pick slot 2 (Open Farm)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_PROTOCOL_GUT_BALANCE_AFF_2_URL=https://...

# Other slugs: MAX_MOVEMENT, FREEDOM_CALM, LIVER_KIDNEY_DETOX, INFRARED_SPINE,
# ALLERGY_SHIELD, FRESH_SMILE_DENTAL, HEART_STRONG, PATRIOT_IMMUNE, CLEAR_VISION
# Slots: AFF_1, AFF_2, AFF_3 (gut-balance has 3 slots; most protocols have 2)
```

Verify: `GET /api/protocols/affiliate-status`

## Safe Picks (`/wellness/safe-products`)

Curated non-toxic chews, toys, and home products. Brands show as **Launching soon** until affiliate URLs are set.

```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_PRODUCTS_ENABLED=true

# Product id → env key (hyphens become underscores)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_WEST_PAW_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_WHIMZEES_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_EARTH_ANIMAL_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_PLANET_DOG_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_OUTWARD_HOUND_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_BOW_WOW_LABS_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_BRANCH_BASICS_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_FORCE_OF_NATURE_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_WYZE_URL=https://...
NEXT_PUBLIC_FP_SAFE_RUFFWEAR_URL=https://...
```

Verify: `GET /api/wellness/safe-products-status`
